    <item>
      <title>实测Visa信用卡秒批秒刷付款 不用等实体卡邮寄</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2500238</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2500238</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 04:19:43 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;前天晚上心血来潮，看到站里有大佬申请giffgaff 电话卡，刚好自己手里有日版无锁iPhone ，说干就干申请esim 结果卡在&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/images/emoji/twemoji/pound_banknote.png?v=15&quot; title=&quot;:pound_banknote:&quot; class=&quot;emoji&quot; alt=&quot;:pound_banknote:&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot;&gt;10的支付环节。&lt;br&gt;
抱着死马当做活马医的心态，选择了工行和浦发两个常用的银行分别申请，浦发秒批9w额度visa ，工行磨蹭2天了还是审批中。&lt;br&gt;
选卡直接免年费的就好，我没啥别的需求，浦发申请信用卡页面上方搜索栏写visa 后搜索就行。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/c/d/2/cd2935276fb7b9e7bcb4924389971aec0d894cb2.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/tgWarhIkYl6PxhUFYhtwD4N1sVI.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;Screenshot_2026-06-30-12-01-47-83_e39d2c7de19156b0683cd93e8735f348&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/d/2/cd2935276fb7b9e7bcb4924389971aec0d894cb2_2_227x500.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;Screenshot_2026-06-30-12-01-47-83_e39d2c7de19156b0683cd93e8735f348&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;tgWarhIkYl6PxhUFYhtwD4N1sVI&quot; width=&quot;227&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/d/2/cd2935276fb7b9e7bcb4924389971aec0d894cb2_2_227x500.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/d/2/cd2935276fb7b9e7bcb4924389971aec0d894cb2_2_340x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/d/2/cd2935276fb7b9e7bcb4924389971aec0d894cb2_2_454x1000.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;CBD1DD&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;重点来了，信用卡秒批后页面里显示数字卡可以直接用了，验证身份后显示ccv 和卡号，返回到giffgaff 填入此新申请的信用卡付款方式就直接扣款&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/images/emoji/twemoji/pound_banknote.png?v=15&quot; title=&quot;:pound_banknote:&quot; class=&quot;emoji&quot; alt=&quot;:pound_banknote:&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot;&gt;10。之后esim 成功写入就可以使用了&lt;br&gt;
补充：付款方式中必填的信用卡有效期我是推算的5年后的同一个月份，通过了。可能这个限制不严格。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/9/4/6/9468f4798ff2008c394bc5ab1e19e22add5c8c10.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/laTwTKTxBqyJm97teGfbfk2xSyA.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;Screenshot_2026-06-30-12-14-52-83_cf3cf72bd8e53b0db7ddb0a6f2208af9&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/9/4/6/9468f4798ff2008c394bc5ab1e19e22add5c8c10_2_227x500.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;Screenshot_2026-06-30-12-14-52-83_cf3cf72bd8e53b0db7ddb0a6f2208af9&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;laTwTKTxBqyJm97teGfbfk2xSyA&quot; width=&quot;227&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/9/4/6/9468f4798ff2008c394bc5ab1e19e22add5c8c10_2_227x500.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/9/4/6/9468f4798ff2008c394bc5ab1e19e22add5c8c10_2_340x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/9/4/6/9468f4798ff2008c394bc5ab1e19e22add5c8c10_2_454x1000.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;E6E7E7&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt;4 个帖子 - 4 位参与者&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/2500238&quot;&gt;阅读完整话题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
          </description>
    </item>
