我们为社区佬友准备了专属的测试额度，添加我们并发送暗号：&lt;strong&gt;佬友&lt;/strong&gt;，直接领取额度开跑。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/7/b/1/7b15aadfdd3b375b45a8e1eeff92519b67626741.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/hyR9niOJ2qz00WG9KlZZQ4X9sL7.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;客服微信&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/7/b/1/7b15aadfdd3b375b45a8e1eeff92519b67626741.png&quot; alt=&quot;客服微信&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;hyR9niOJ2qz00WG9KlZZQ4X9sL7&quot; width=&quot;205&quot; height=&quot;205&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/d/9/1/d912576f986ca4f3d91069e7153e8bd5b757bd4e.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/uYiUh56IpNqZbrpUiZ9isF5BCzQ.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;多元探索佬友·交流群&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/d/9/1/d912576f986ca4f3d91069e7153e8bd5b757bd4e_2_240x375.png&quot; alt=&quot;多元探索佬友·交流群&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;uYiUh56IpNqZbrpUiZ9isF5BCzQ&quot; width=&quot;240&quot; height=&quot;375&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/d/9/1/d912576f986ca4f3d91069e7153e8bd5b757bd4e_2_240x375.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/d/9/1/d912576f986ca4f3d91069e7153e8bd5b757bd4e_2_360x562.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/d/9/1/d912576f986ca4f3d91069e7153e8bd5b757bd4e_2_480x750.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;EBEBEC&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;具体支持的模型、价格、倍率和活动规则以官网实际展示为准。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;别想那么多，免费的额度用了再说！&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/images/emoji/twemoji/four_leaf_clover.png?v=15&quot; title=&quot;:four_leaf_clover:&quot; class=&quot;emoji&quot; alt=&quot;:four_leaf_clover:&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot;&gt; 评论区抽佬友送额度&lt;br&gt;
欢迎大家在评论区交流反馈，本帖将随机抽取幸运佬友，每人赠送 10 元额度！&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt;36 个帖子 - 16 位参与者&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/2500141&quot;&gt;阅读完整话题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
          </description>
    </item>
